      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1795362535549,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "PAST-Bench 归因评测流水线（清空隔离 → 四角色回合 → 持久化消融 → 遥测取证 → 双轴归因）",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "PAST-Bench 归因评测流水线（清空隔离 → 四角色回合 → 持久化消融 → 遥测取证 → 双轴归因）",
      "lineHeight": 1.36,
      "autoResize": true
    },
    {
      "id": "txt_0043",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1782.4,
      "y": 1858,
      "width": 1312.2,
      "height": 38.1,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#495057",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1172954587,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 109320382,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1795362535549,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "以「任务族」而非单题为评测单元，通过严格会话隔离与四类对照回合把真实自进化从噪声中剥离出来",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
